NOTE ON LAWFUL USE

This project describes a device that captures audio of conversations involving
people other than its wearer. In the European Union, ePrivacy Directive
Art. 5(1) requires the consent of all parties to a communication. GDPR's
household exemption (Art. 2(2)(c)) covers strictly personal and domestic use
only and does not extend to a distributed product or service.

Anyone building, distributing or operating this design is responsible for
compliance in their jurisdiction. See docs/RISKS.md.
